# Reports and logs

Tables: `{$wpdb->prefix}cli_reports` (`longtext` content) and `{$wpdb->prefix}cli_logs` (`varchar(1000)`). Schema version lives on `Installer`. Admin UI: Maintenance → Reports / Logs.

Create the report once, append CSV **per batch**, never per post. `Report::to_csv()` writes rows only — pass the header in `create()`.

```php
protected function before_run(): void {
	$this->report = Report::create(
		__( 'Report name', 'maintenance-tools-wcus26' ),
		"id,title,url\n"
	);
}

protected function after_batch( array $posts ): void {
	if ( ! $this->report instanceof Report || empty( $this->batch_rows ) ) {
		return;
	}
	$this->report->append( Report::to_csv( $this->batch_rows ) );
	$this->batch_rows = array();
}
```
